Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)我是贾吉·戴比尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击安布拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种感觉到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((皇子 贝库塔大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在命运之日诞生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是和平的象征是神的转世！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)贝库塔大人 贝库塔大人 贝库塔大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和平吗… 无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}财富与权力就是要用力量夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出击！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切夺走！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切化为乌有！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗 去战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王… 王倒下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王已经再也站不起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在能拯救这个国家的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.35,0:01:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托您了 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 母上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不喜好争斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个国家的人们能够和平幸福地生活{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我衷心祈愿。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位 让我们共同构筑未来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么!? 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然与敌国缔结了和议!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货 蠢货啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只差一步 邻国就成为我国领土了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 父上！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 再也无法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着百姓因战争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不断死去。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住口！ 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 从我这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会生出什么和平的象征{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种没用的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}父王……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是为了把我荣光踩在脚下才出生的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定是被诅咒的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}懦夫 去死吧 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}父王！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}母后！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:02:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}母后！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王啊 亲手杀害自己的孩子万万不可。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}父王！ 母后！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你并非悲剧的皇子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是会成为疯狂的皇子。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞多)你将会和这位王一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}流淌着残虐之血。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其唤醒，成为我野望的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是杀害了父母的残虐皇子。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让这个世界化为血海{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而诞生))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)这就是贝库塔的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)真正的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)他也 同样和其他七皇一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被千尊操控着。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的… 怎么会这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那就是 我身为人类时的真正记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也就是说 是假的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我亲手杀害父母这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 你也看来你也察觉到真相了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 把我……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我给骗了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德！都是因为你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔的心才……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心才坏掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}经历过那种事那也是理所当然的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 你原本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是个心地善良的家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现在我面前的 真月零。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是你的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才是真正的你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…… 真月才是 我真正的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔简直是理想的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越是纯粹其反作用下诞生的黑暗就越深。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了作为强大的巴利安重生啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不是你扭曲了记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔本是个温柔的皇子。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这男人残虐非道的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是事实。那无法抹去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，我过去犯下的罪不会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔，那种事重新来过就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过去虽然无法抹去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.53,0:07:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来却可以从现在开始描绘。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你们，游马，小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我这种人不该拥有未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你们和纳修折磨到这种地步的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪配拥有未来……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人·释放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 对方通过舍弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的艾克西斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你什么意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 这就是我的赎罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那只怪兽给我致命一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同我体内的上千主上一起把我葬送吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算同归于尽吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求你了 把我……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同我这肮脏不堪的过去一起抹消掉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦！竟敢耍这种小聪明。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快！趁我按住这家伙的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修，拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:09:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于额外卡组·抽离的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌将梦魇·鲨鱼送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，你场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我全部收下。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，动手吧，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等啊，鲨鱼！贝库塔他……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，只能这样了只能这样了……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动手吧，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用拉格纳·无限……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 诡计·爆冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 只有在对方场上存在怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并向我发起攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:09:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那次攻击无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将对方的攻击表示怪兽全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！ 上当了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？ 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不就是你们看到的那样嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都上当了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被本大爷的精湛演技给骗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么乖乖地上当了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是没救的天真鬼啊你们这群人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我就把你送到同伴那儿去。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过在那之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先把碍事的神之类的解决掉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.03,0:11:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，早就已经察觉到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你把我过去的记忆篡改过这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，你对我们所做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然也是你所期望的……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，我啊，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着你们痛苦的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直开心得不得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊，对敢动我记忆的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是很不爽的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔，你这家伙本应无法违抗我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的得到七皇之力的本大爷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量可比你这家伙更强啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度的力量你竟然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把咚·千葬送了吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 纳修。下一个就是你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡计·巴士特的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每破坏1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要承受300点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就给我收下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 3只份 900点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见吧 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦·鲨的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果伤害无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是相信我的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种感情{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 早就和身为人类时的记忆一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丢掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……你这家伙，纳修，我饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识，我真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，升阶魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动阿德迈尔死亡千！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从双方的墓地中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将相同阶级的混沌超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按所需数量选出{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那些怪兽比原本持有的阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1个等级并复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且暗黑骑士！安布拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高贵恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拉格纳·无限！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这些家伙可以召唤出艾克西斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用升到6级的4只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量叠加！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接混沌艾克西斯·变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.5！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌世界的亡者们！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在将那些灵魂融为一体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临于这浑浊的世界吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亡胧龙 混沌·奇美拉龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了 纳修！这家伙是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你重要伙伴们的混沌之力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}融合为一体的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·奇美拉龙每有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.67,0:14:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1个混沌超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 发动混沌·奇美拉龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙虽然不能通常攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方的卡组中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随机除外1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减少了1个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会下降1000{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但用来打倒你足够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击梦鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦鲨的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将守备力下降1000点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使战斗造成的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方的卡组中除外1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦想鲨被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会去墓地而是被除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！ 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙的怪兽就没了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外你卡组中的卡并攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会减半但这样就足够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你让我这么开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙可是最棒的玩具啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在已经只是碍眼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:15:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是啊。 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 再见了 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定 结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 深渊守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 将那个战斗伤害无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将这张卡作为等级５的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 这只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将与我本应受到的伤害变得相同！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 你烦不烦啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了 烦死了 烦死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌奇美拉龙 更进一步的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时将除外的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放回对方卡组的最上方。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放１张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《为什么要把除外的卡…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用你自己放回来的这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了结你的性命！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了！ 那可行不通。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.41,0:17:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为混沌·奇美拉龙的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦被除外的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中 无法使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这样的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 鲨鱼的抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就被封了3次。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 混沌·奇美拉龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方回合时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付我一半的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将上个回合使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量·单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 攻击力再次 变为4000！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！ 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等到了下一个回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又会被同样的攻击打过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:17:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈… 明白了吗，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次才是真正的终结了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来讽刺的是，你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反倒救了我一命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无限三叉戟！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据对方怪兽所持有的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组将卡送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我要将4张卡送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 尽是些没用的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我抽1张新卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽到 混沌壁垒！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 深渊噬咬者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有怪兽超量存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以不用解放召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的深渊守卫者和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊猎手进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 No.73！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷神 深渊溅射！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动深渊溅射的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗结束攻击力变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 深渊溅射！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击混沌奇美拉龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 太天真了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你太天真了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 叠放爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到对方怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽的一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归为己有！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 混沌奇美拉龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是用两个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来提升攻击力的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明就是你赢了啊真可惜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 这样下去的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼要输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:20:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 决斗继续！ 再见啦 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要结束的是 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快速混沌发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法的升阶魔法!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的 超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌化 并升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.73！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲破卷曲混沌的水流
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 浮上那片大地吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷瀑神 深渊·史普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这家伙 把你葬入黑暗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊·史普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击混沌·奇美拉龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力才3000左右！ 反杀你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊·史普拉的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个混沌超量单元使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加在这只怪兽的攻击力上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·奇美拉龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的攻击力是5000。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 深渊·史普拉的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升5000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 现在正是该坠入无光之暗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着你那邪恶的灵魂坠落吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！ 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧 矢量！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《笨蛋… 我我居然会输!?》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.55,0:23:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:23:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
